From c370b279b9f61066b69853b3458c726a73681d8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johann Felfer <31707158+HansFel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:35:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(post): Grbl 1.1 post for 3-axis mills

Add grbl.cps and the Grbl 3-axis machine. Grbl 1.1 has no canned
cycles, no cutter compensation and no tool table, so drill cycles post
as G0/G1/G4 moves, bore and tap are refused by name, a tool change is
M0 with comments, and a line is at most 79 characters.

Fixes #2481

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
