+//! Regenerate after an intentional change, then read the diff:
+//! `WRITE_GOLDEN=1 cargo test -p camcraft-post --test script_hurco_winmax`
+//!
+//! Gate map (M4.4): covers assets/posts/hurco-winmax.cps, camcraft_post::post::engine,
